      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-04-06T22:52:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes. Is this current result \"correct\"? I would expect that the result would be \nInclude: A, X   (that arch inclusion overrides global exclusion)",
      "parentUuid": "e4e97ae4_b16c6a40",
      "revId": "50acbd5b40602eacad36b58efa74ca73cd638275",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
