      "writtenOn": "2021-04-07T03:39:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "since LabelLists are computed by BazelLabelForModuleSrc{Excludes} from []string slices of included and excluded globs/lists, I think we shouldn\u0027t bother with the Excludes field here? The Excludes field is not used in the code generator (it only prettyprints Includes), and I\u0027m not what else actually uses it, or if it\u0027s even useful as a LabelList field.",
      "parentUuid": "44fa25bd_92e9c564",
